# Railway Docker build context for `ui-web` (apps/web/Dockerfile; the service lives in
# delacour-monorepo's apps/ui/infra/railway.ts). The build stage runs its own `bun install`, so a
# host node_modules (macOS-native addons) would only bloat the context and could shadow it.
#
# Every workspace package.json must stay in the context — `bun install --frozen-lockfile` refuses a
# workspace set that does not match bun.lock — so only generated output is excluded, never a
# workspace directory.
**/node_modules
**/.output
**/.nitro
**/.tanstack
**/.vinxi
**/.turbo
**/.expo
**/.source
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
apps/*/ios
apps/*/android
.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
